---
const year = new Date().getFullYear()

const runtimeLinks = [
  { href: 'https://crates.io/crates/etassia', label: 'crates.io · etassia' },
  { href: 'https://rubygems.org/gems/etassia', label: 'RubyGems · etassia' },
  { href: 'https://rubygems.org/gems/etassia-native', label: 'RubyGems · etassia-native' },
  { href: 'https://pypi.org/project/etassia/', label: 'PyPI · etassia' },
  { href: 'https://www.npmjs.com/package/etassia', label: 'npm · etassia' },
]

const siteLinks = [
  { href: '/syntax', label: 'Diagram syntaxes' },
  { href: '/playground', label: 'Playground' },
  { href: '/about', label: 'About' },
]
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-rule dark:border-rule-dark">
  <!-- The footer carries the drawing sheet's title block: who drew it, from what, on which boundary. -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_auto] gap-8 md:gap-14">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="block-label">Etassia &mdash; from the Greek &#7940;&#954;&#964;&#940;&#963;&#963;&#969;, drawn up in formation</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-ink-soft dark:text-ink-soft-dark">
          Etassia is a diagram-rendering engine. It reads Mermaid diagram syntax and produces
          SVG output that is byte-identical across the Ruby, Rust, Python, and WebAssembly
          runtimes.
        </p>
        <p class="hash-label mt-3">native boundary: etassia_render · etassia_detect · etassia_free</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="block-label">Site</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          {siteLinks.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} class="text-sm text-ink-soft dark:text-ink-soft-dark hover:text-pen dark:hover:text-pen-dark underline-offset-2 hover:underline">{link.label}</a>
            </li>
          ))}
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/etassia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-ink-soft dark:text-ink-soft-dark hover:text-pen dark:hover:text-pen-dark underline-offset-2 hover:underline">GitHub organization</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="block-label">Packages</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          {runtimeLinks.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-ink-soft dark:text-ink-soft-dark hover:text-pen dark:hover:text-pen-dark underline-offset-2 hover:underline">{link.label}</a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-5 border-t border-rule dark:border-rule-dark flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p class="hash-label">&copy; {year} Ribose. Released under the BSD-2-Clause license.</p>
      <p class="hash-label">sheet set: etassia.org</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
